    "homepage": "https://wordpress.org/themes/online-school-courses/",
    "sections": {
        "description": "The Online School Courses theme is a modern, responsive, and versatile solution designed for educational institutions, online schools, e-learning platforms, course providers, tutoring centers, coaching classes, training institutes, virtual classrooms, skill development programs, professional certification programs, and digital learning platforms. Ideal for online school websites, course catalogs, e-learning portals, online training programs, distance learning platforms, virtual education portals, and educational websites, this theme ensures a user-friendly experience across desktops, tablets, and mobile devices. It is suitable for presenting online classes, video courses, study programs, academic courses, professional training, coaching sessions, certification courses, workshops, and skill-based learning programs. The theme includes dedicated sections for course listings, course categories, instructor profiles, student testimonials, banners, learning highlights, and strategically placed call-to-action buttons to encourage enrollments and engagement. Built with secure, optimized, and SEO-friendly code, it ensures fast loading performance while allowing easy customization of layouts, colors, and typography to match your institution’s branding. The theme works smoothly with the WooCommerce plugin for selling courses online, Contact Form 7 for student inquiries and support, and the LearnPress plugin for creating, managing, and delivering online courses with lessons, quizzes, and student progress tracking. With blog support, translation readiness, social media integration, and a responsive layout, Online School Courses provides a professional and high-performing platform for schools, tutors, training centers, and e-learning providers to deliver education online, attract students, and manage digital learning efficiently."
    },
